{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Commit:** `7f31c6d4818da53fc886723f47bbfce7ed8a81d0`  \n**`git diff --stat HEAD~1`:** 8 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 255 deletions(-)\n\n| Item | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| **a** | **Applied** — removed `verify_block`/`compose_prompt` and their tests; only `status_block` remains. |\n| **b** | **Applied** — removed empty `WaitOpts` from `dispatch`/`wait`. |\n| **c** | **Applied** — `dispatch` always returns `String` job id; dropped sync path, `background`/`wait_ms`, and `DispatchResult`. |\n| **d** | **Applied** — removed `RunOutput.downgraded` and all initializers. |\n| **e** | **Applied** — removed unused `NoopStatusWriter`. |\n| **f** | **Skipped** — `job` tests still inject `fake_finalize` via `JobDeps.finalize` / `finalize_stall`; removing the seam would break those tests. |\n\n**Tests:** lib **126**, `budgets` **6**, `cli_e2e` **27**, `cli_info_e2e` **5**, `live` **1 ignored** (unchanged e2e files).\n\n**Also:** `bin/setup.sh` runs `rmdir` on the old `cursor-delegate` config dir after profile migration.\n\n**Friction**\n- Hypothesis (c) required rewriting two job unit tests that depended on blocking `DispatchResult::Output`, not the CLI e2e suite.\n- Lib test count dropped by six purely from deleting prompt tests, which is expected but easy to misread as a regression.\n- Keeping `FinalizeFn` on `JobDeps` is a small leftover solely for test injection.\n\nSTATUS: DONE"}]},"session_id":"e2d994f1-ef61-48a1-b218-cde928b7cc82"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":113146,"duration_api_ms":113146,"is_error":false,"result":"Reviewing the codebase and applying repairs.\n\n\nImplementing changes.\n\n\n**Commit:** `7f31c6d4818da53fc886723f47bbfce7ed8a81d0`  \n**`git diff --stat HEAD~1`:** 8 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 255 deletions(-)\n\n| Item | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| **a** | **Applied** — removed `verify_block`/`compose_prompt` and their tests; only `status_block` remains. |\n| **b** | **Applied** — removed empty `WaitOpts` from `dispatch`/`wait`. |\n| **c** | **Applied** — `dispatch` always returns `String` job id; dropped sync path, `background`/`wait_ms`, and `DispatchResult`. |\n| **d** | **Applied** — removed `RunOutput.downgraded` and all initializers. |\n| **e** | **Applied** — removed unused `NoopStatusWriter`. |\n| **f** | **Skipped** — `job` tests still inject `fake_finalize` via `JobDeps.finalize` / `finalize_stall`; removing the seam would break those tests. |\n\n**Tests:** lib **126**, `budgets` **6**, `cli_e2e` **27**, `cli_info_e2e` **5**, `live` **1 ignored** (unchanged e2e files).\n\n**Also:** `bin/setup.sh` runs `rmdir` on the old `cursor-delegate` config dir after profile migration.\n\n**Friction**\n- Hypothesis (c) required rewriting two job unit tests that depended on blocking `DispatchResult::Output`, not the CLI e2e suite.\n- Lib test count dropped by six purely from deleting prompt tests, which is expected but easy to misread as a regression.\n- Keeping `FinalizeFn` on `JobDeps` is a small leftover solely for test injection.\n\nSTATUS: DONE","session_id":"e2d994f1-ef61-48a1-b218-cde928b7cc82","request_id":"2bc2e16e-0d86-4adb-8cce-1a1e1e63cb19","usage":{"inputTokens":27563,"outputTokens":11469,"cacheReadTokens":1377631,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
